  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39760374",
      "title": "Adding a Header Component",
      "sourceHash": "a5bc32a5c5c488de8aca735e1984d44589a741e72215ec08230c2f8c6ed2d875",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.72,
          "end": 3.6,
          "en": "So let me walk you through my solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.6,
          "end": 6.6,
          "en": "And for that here, I'll start in the SRC folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.6,
          "end": 9.3,
          "en": "and I'll start by adding a new Components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.3,
          "end": 12.93,
          "en": "because of course we're going to add some components here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.93,
          "end": 15.3,
          "en": "And I will start my solution here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.3,
          "end": 19.32,
          "en": "by adding a header component, a header.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.32,
          "end": 24.32,
          "en": "which exports a header component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.48,
          "end": 27.57,
          "en": "And the idea behind this header component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.57,
          "end": 31.68,
          "en": "is of course to simply be used here in the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.68,
          "end": 36.68,
          "en": "so that in there I can output my logo and my title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.41,
          "end": 40.44,
          "en": "And we could definitely alternatively",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.44,
          "end": 45.33,
          "en": "also add the header code right here in the index.html file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.33,
          "end": 47.52,
          "en": "That would be possible as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.52,
          "end": 50.94,
          "en": "because the header component I'm about to build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.94,
          "end": 54,
          "en": "will not really be dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54,
          "end": 56.793,
          "en": "But here, I'll go for the component approach instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.63,
          "end": 60.6,
          "en": "And therefore here in this header component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.6,
          "end": 62.97,
          "en": "I'll of course return some JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.97,
          "end": 65.67,
          "en": "because that is what you'll do in components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.67,
          "end": 68.55,
          "en": "And I'll return a header element in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.55,
          "end": 71.78999999999999,
          "en": "the built in header HTML element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.78999999999999,
          "end": 75.273,
          "en": "or JSX element here to be very precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.47,
          "end": 81.077,
          "en": "And in this header, I want to have an image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.077,
          "end": 84.51,
          "en": "and I want to have an H1 tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.51,
          "end": 88.95,
          "en": "And between those H1 tags, I'll say Investment Calculator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.95,
          "end": 90.78,
          "en": "So that'll be the main title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.78,
          "end": 92.673,
          "en": "that should show up on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.63,
          "end": 97.17,
          "en": "And here for the image, I'll add a source,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.17,
          "end": 99.90899999999999,
          "en": "which I'll set to a dynamic value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.90899999999999,
          "end": 102.75,
          "en": "because I want to import this investment calculator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.75,
          "end": 105.663,
          "en": "PNG file, which you'll find in the Assets folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.58,
          "end": 112.58,
          "en": "So for that here in header.jsx, we can import this logo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 112.62,
          "end": 113.793,
          "en": "The name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 115.00800000000001,
          "end": 119.37899999999999,
          "en": "From, and then here the path is going up one level",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 119.37899999999999,
          "end": 122.61,
          "en": "because we are in the Components folder right now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 122.61,
          "end": 125.22,
          "en": "and the Assets folder is in the Source folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 125.22,
          "end": 128.073,
          "en": "which is the parent folder of the Components folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.957,
          "end": 131.13,
          "en": "So therefore we need to go up one level",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 131.13,
          "end": 133.71,
          "en": "then dive into the Assets folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.71,
          "end": 138.71,
          "en": "and then target this investment-calculator.png file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 140.07,
          "end": 142.41,
          "en": "And with that, we can use this logo here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 142.41,
          "end": 145.653,
          "en": "as a dynamic value for this SRC attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.73,
          "end": 151.73,
          "en": "And for the alt text, I say, logo showing a money bag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 152.19,
          "end": 155.313,
          "en": "because in the end that is what you can see on this logo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 159.24,
          "end": 162.03,
          "en": "With that, I have this basic header component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 162.03,
          "end": 164.57999999999998,
          "en": "and we can now of course use this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 164.57999999999998,
          "end": 165.96,
          "en": "in the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 165.96,
          "end": 168.48,
          "en": "which is the root component of this app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 168.48,
          "end": 172.26,
          "en": "since it's this app component that is being rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 172.26,
          "end": 175.59,
          "en": "by the ReactDOM part of the React library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 175.59,
          "end": 178.803,
          "en": "into this HTML element with the ID root.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 179.97,
          "end": 184.97,
          "en": "So into this div here, which has this ID root on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 186.81,
          "end": 188.97,
          "en": "Therefore, in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 188.97,
          "end": 193.35,
          "en": "I'll replace this H1 element with my custom header component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 193.35,
          "end": 195.9,
          "en": "which starts with an uppercase character.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 195.9,
          "end": 198.93,
          "en": "And we of course also must add this import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 198.93,
          "end": 201.87,
          "en": "to the header component to make this header component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 201.87,
          "end": 204.21,
          "en": "which is defined in a different file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 204.21,
          "end": 207,
          "en": "available in this app.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 207,
          "end": 211.02,
          "en": "And we should add .jsx here in this import path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 211.02,
          "end": 212.613,
          "en": "at the end of this import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 215.31,
          "end": 218.07,
          "en": "And with that, if you save that and you got that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 218.07,
          "end": 221.88,
          "en": "development server up and running, if I reload this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 221.88,
          "end": 224.79,
          "en": "I'm getting an error that it's not finding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 224.79,
          "end": 226.683,
          "en": "that image as it seems.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 228.78,
          "end": 230.19,
          "en": "Might be a typo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 230.19,
          "end": 233.673,
          "en": "Yeah, the image had a dash logo at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 235.02,
          "end": 237.39,
          "en": "But with that fixture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 237.39,
          "end": 240.12,
          "en": "we see the image here and we see the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 240.12,
          "end": 242.19,
          "en": "And of course now it would be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 242.19,
          "end": 245.528,
          "en": "if the styles would look a bit nicer here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 245.528,
          "end": 246.93,
          "en": "And to achieve that, we can take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 246.93,
          "end": 248.85,
          "en": "at the index.css file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 248.85,
          "end": 251.25,
          "en": "And in there we'll find some rules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 251.25,
          "end": 256.25,
          "en": "that look for an element that has the ID header on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 257.58,
          "end": 259.53,
          "en": "And that will be used for styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 259.53,
          "end": 262.89,
          "en": "and for styling the image tag inside of an element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 262.89,
          "end": 265.29,
          "en": "with that ID on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 265.29,
          "end": 267.51,
          "en": "And therefore, back in header.jsx,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 267.51,
          "end": 272.51,
          "en": "we can achieve a nicer styling by adding the ID prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 272.52,
          "end": 277.323,
          "en": "to the header element and setting this to header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 279.36,
          "end": 281.01,
          "en": "And with the ID added here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 281.01,
          "end": 283.74,
          "en": "this header looks much nicer and we can therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 283.74,
          "end": 286.863,
          "en": "move on to the next part of this practice app.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
